      "description": "Hentikan: the single destructive-coloured control.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-stop\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M6 6h12v12H6z\"/></svg>Hentikan</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-stop{font-family: Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#410E0B;background:#F9DEDC;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;cursor:pointer}.ds-btn-stop:hover{filter:brightness(.96)}.ds-btn-stop:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #410E0B;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Location Pill",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "location-pill",
      "description": "Header location with GPS refresh.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-pill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\"><path fill=\"#0F4C3A\" d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg>Jakarta Pusat</button>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{font-family: Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#181816;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E2DDD2;border-radius:9999px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer}.ds-pill:hover{background:#EDE9E0}.ds-pill:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0F4C3A;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation Bar",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-bar",
